# Highlander Gold & Silver — Admin Dashboard Environment Configuration (OPTIONAL)
# The application works out of the box using centralized configuration in src/lib/supabaseConfig.js.
# No .env file is required for development or production.
# 
# Only create a .env file if you wish to override the default Highlander project connection:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-custom-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-custom-anon-key
# 
# Note: Never place service_role secret keys or database passwords in frontend files.
